---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Nexus Remote Hub" description="Who's behind Nexus Remote Hub: Mada, a developer building a remote career from scratch, writing with an AI co-writer.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,')] opacity-20"></div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-24">
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
          <span class="block bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-blue-100 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Going remote,</span>
          <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">in the open</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          I'm Mada, a developer building a remote career from scratch. This blog is the field notes — what actually works, what doesn't, and what it costs, with real numbers instead of "best practices."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who I Am -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 sm:text-4xl mb-6">Who I am</h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg mb-6">
          I'm a developer based in Poland. I build websites and fix security issues for small businesses — that's the day job. But the long-term goal is fully remote, asynchronous work, and this blog documents the road there in real time.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-6">
          I don't write listicles about "the 10 best tools for nomads." I run real tests, keep the numbers, and publish the results — including the ones that don't flatter me. If a claim here can't be backed by something I actually did or measured, I say so.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg">
          Every post is written with <strong>Hermes, an AI co-writer</strong>. I decide the topic, the angle, and the numbers; the AI helps with drafting, structure, and editing. I'm transparent about that because the point of this blog is honesty, not the illusion of a guru.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How I Work -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 sm:text-4xl mb-8">What you can expect here</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 mb-2">Real numbers, not vibes</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Costs, time, reply rates — measured, with sample sizes stated honestly. A reply rate out of 15 emails is an anecdote, not a metric, and I'll label it as such.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 mb-2">Mistakes in the open</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">The failed outreach campaign, the tool that didn't pay off, the time I burned. If I only posted wins, there'd be nothing to learn from.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 mb-2">Written with AI, labeled as such</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">No anonymous "we." The byline says Mada, the bio says AI co-writer, and the About page says it too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 text-white py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl mb-6">Have a question or a project?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Get in touch — I build websites and fix security issues for small businesses.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-md text-blue-700 bg-white hover:bg-blue-50 transition-colors">
          Contact Me
        </a>
        <a href="/blog" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 border border-white text-base font-medium rounded-md text-white hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
          Read the Blog
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
